#: ../../project_and_asset_management/file_management/auto_save.rst:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Backup files (auto saves) are generated according to the settings in :"
#| "menuselection:`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive -->` :doc:`Misc </"
#| "getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_misc>` (default is every "
#| "60 seconds and/or 25 operations). This is where you can switch it on or "
#| "off."
msgid ""
"Auto-save files are generated according to the settings in :menuselection:"
"`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive --> Misc` see :doc:`Misc </"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_misc>` (default is every 60 "
"seconds and/or 25 operations). This is where you can switch it on or off."
msgstr ""
"Izdelava varnostnih kopij (samodejno shranjevanje) poteka skladno z "
"nastavitvami pod :menuselection:`Meni --> Nastavitve --> Prilagodi Kdenlive "
"-->` :doc:`Razno </getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_misc>` "
"(privzeto vsakih 60 s in/ali 25 dejanj). To je mesto, kjer lahko to funkcijo "
"vklopite ali izklopite."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/file_management/auto_save.rst:29
msgid ""
"Creating a backup file is offered the first time after you open the project "
"again in case the auto save is newer than the version of the last saved "
"project file."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje varnostne kopije datoteke je na voljo prvič po ponovnem "
"odpiranju projekta, če je samodejno shranjeno novejše od zadnje shranjene "
"različice projektne datoteke."

